WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:29.189
A silence has fallen over the north side of
Altaussee.

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:33.040
This part of the village lies in the path
of a potential avalanche that authorities

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.880
say could trigger without warning.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.130
More than 100 people have had to evacuate.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:46.430
A few come back now and then to clear their
roofs or driveways in a contest with the snow.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.070
It has been snowing now here for nearly two
weeks.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:52.360
The residents tell us they haven’t seen
anything like it in over a decade.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.829
There’s a break in the weather now, the
sun is out, but even if the sun shines, it

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:59.340
does not mean the danger of avalanches is
gone.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:03.270
The snow has accumulated, it’s sitting there,
and it could fall off the mountain, on to

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.100
these houses at any time.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.439
Breaks in the snowfall have only been temporary.

00:01:10.439 --> 00:01:15.259
Here in lower Altaussee, the residents are
getting on with their lives - even if that

00:01:15.259 --> 00:01:19.440
means hard work.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.689
I'm used to all this snow.

00:01:21.689 --> 00:01:28.229
But it's a bit rough this time that we've
had so much at once.

00:01:28.229 --> 00:01:31.780
We're trying to clear just the top layer,
the loose stuff.

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:35.659
Because if it rains into this, then it will
become really heavy.

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:41.680
The village is normally packed with tourists
at this time of the year.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:48.490
Instead the luxury hotels like this one have
opened their doors to evacuees free of charge.

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:50.570
Altausee has pulled together before.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:54.479
In 2006 they had to evacuate for a few days.

00:01:54.479 --> 00:02:00.080
And it's that community spirit that locals
say will help them through again.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.500
Avalanche or not.

